 * Parse content string into typed blocks with heading-based splitting and fence handling.
 *
 * ALGORITHM:
 * 1. Start with empty block
 * 2. Process line-by-line:
 *    - If inside fence: add all lines (including headings) to current block
 *    - If heading (outside fence): finalize current block, start new block with heading
 *    - Otherwise: add line to current block
 * 3. Finalize remaining content as last block
 *
